reagent-name-go-juice = go-juice
seeds-go-juice-name = go-leaf
seeds-go-juice-display-name = go-leaf
ent-GoJuicePlantSeeds = packet of go-leaf seeds
    .desc = Seeds of a rare plant whose leaves contain go-juice.
ent-GoJuiceLeaves = go-leaf leaves
    .desc = A bundle of thick leaves with mint-green veins. Grind them to extract go-juice or use a seed extractor to obtain more seeds.
reagent-desc-go-juice = A combat stimulant that temporarily increases movement and melee attack speed. Metabolism also satisfies genetic go-juice dependency.
reagent-effect-guidebook-combat-stimulant = Increases movement speed by { $movement }% and melee attack rate by { $attack }% for { $duration } seconds per unit, up to { $maximum } seconds remaining. Satisfies genetic dependency on this reagent in proportion to the metabolized dose.
ent-GoJuiceChemistryBottle = go-juice bottle
    .desc = A combat stimulant containing 30 units of go-juice. Without an existing withdrawal deficit, this satisfies genetic dependency for 30 minutes.
ent-GoJuiceAutoInjector15 = go-juice microinjector (15 units)
    .desc = A single-use injector containing 15 units of go-juice. Injects the entire dose.
ent-GoJuiceAutoInjector30 = go-juice injector (30 units)
    .desc = A single-use injector containing 30 units of go-juice. Injects the entire dose.
ent-GoJuiceAutoInjector45 = large go-juice injector (45 units)
    .desc = A single-use injector containing 45 units of go-juice. Injects the entire dose. The body's dependency reserve is still limited to 30 minutes.
ent-AsakimGoJuiceAutoInjector15 = VEF go-juice microinjector (15 units)
    .desc = A single-use VEF injector containing 15 units of go-juice, marked with one cyan stripe. Injects the entire dose.
ent-AsakimGoJuiceAutoInjector30 = VEF go-juice injector (30 units)
    .desc = A single-use VEF injector containing 30 units of go-juice, marked with two cyan stripes. Injects the entire dose.
ent-AsakimGoJuiceAutoInjector45 = large VEF go-juice injector (45 units)
    .desc = A single-use VEF injector containing 45 units of go-juice, marked with three cyan stripes. Injects the entire dose. The body's dependency reserve is still limited to 30 minutes.
ent-GeneticInjectorGoJuiceDependency = go-juice dependency genetic injector
    .desc = An administrative injector that activates the go-juice dependency gene.
genetics-gene-go-juice-dependency = Go-juice dependency
genetics-gene-go-juice-dependency-desc = Grants 60 genetic stability but requires regular go-juice. Each metabolized unit replenishes one minute of reserve, up to 30 minutes. Deficiency causes weakness, slower attacks and, after 5 minutes, toxin damage. The accumulated deficit must also be repaid with the drug. Reserve consumption, withdrawal progression and withdrawal damage pause while the player is disconnected or outside the body.
genetics-feeling-go-juice-dependency = Your body changes: it now needs go-juice.
alerts-go-juice-dependency-name = Go-juice dependency
alerts-go-juice-dependency-desc = The number shows the remaining minutes of reserve. Withdrawal starts at zero. Click to check the reserve or accumulated deficit. One unit restores one minute, up to 30 minutes.
chemical-dependency-reserve = { $reagent }: approximately { $minutes } minutes of reserve remaining.
chemical-dependency-deficit = You need { $reagent }. Clearing the accumulated deficit requires { $units } units; further doses replenish your reserve.
chemical-dependency-withdrawal-mild = You lack the chemical your body needs. Your movements are slowing down.
chemical-dependency-withdrawal-moderate = Withdrawal is getting worse. Moving and fighting are becoming difficult.
chemical-dependency-withdrawal-severe = Severe withdrawal is damaging your body! Take the required chemical urgently.
